I agree with Hadley, in that much of your research phase should be
completed now. For instance, I know of two projects to integrate
Processing with R (eg. http://r-forge.r-project.org/projects/rprocessing/
) and another project which recently exposed R graphing via the web (http://www.squirelove.net/r-node/doku.php
).  Your proposal would ideally be aware of the existing functionality
and have some sense for how your project would fit in, with some more
specificity about the specific project for the summer.

Sent from my iPhone

