Hi Tal,

Thanks for the nice message! I just sent an e-mail to the list saying I won't be formally submitting this, mainly because I'm worried about continuity and time frames.

However, I think that with a full summer, one could still build a majority of this package (my dissertation is due in August, hence my own fears, and I start a pretty big job in September). This would include having interactive versions of scatterplots, box plots, etc., as well as lower-level functions like text(), lines(), and related functions. New functions would be made to add interactive layers with mouseover effects.

Thanks again for your excitement, and I hope this isn't too disappointing!

Sincerely,
Wojciech

